## 🏗️ The Greatest Estate Developer
* **Genre:** Fantasy / Comedy / Isekai / Kingdom Building
* **Status:** Completed 🏆 *(Part 1 concluded its legendary manhwa run)*
* **My Rating:** ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
* **Key Highlight:** The ultimate king of comedy expressions! Watching civil engineering student Kim Suho scheme, build infrastructure, and scam his way to a peaceful lifestyle inside a noble's body is pure gold. 

## 😈 Chronicles of the Demon Faction
* **Genre:** Action / Murim / Reincarnation
* **Status:** Ongoing ⏳ *(Actively releasing new chapters)*
* **My Rating:** ⭐⭐⭐⭐
* **Key Highlight:** An assassin from the Righteous Alliance is assassinated and wakes up as the young master of the Heavenly Demon Cult. The brilliant shift from stealth martial arts to handling brutal cult politics makes it an incredible read.

